{
  "id": "320001",
  "resourceId": 200,
  "name": "露菲",
  "skin": "預設",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c200_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c200_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "天、啊！一定要買下來！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥，我這身打扮怎麼樣？這樣的衣服也很適合我吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "方舟最棒的約會地點是皇家大道。你問為什麼？因為到處都是名牌商店啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "比起紅蘿蔔，露菲兔更喜歡錢——☆",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "這一個小時，鞋子打五折？雖然我已經擁有超過一百雙鞋子……\n不管了，當然要買☆",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "只要錢夠多，幸運就會自動找上門吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "哎，怎麼辦？買了太多給哥哥的禮物！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "這是特地為哥哥準備的禮物——性感露菲兔！\n怎麼樣，喜歡嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "大家——好！我親愛的露賓們☆\n現在露菲正和誰在一起呢？大家猜一猜！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥，我還為你學了鋼管舞！\n等只有我們兩人的時候就跳給你看☆",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥，我們選一個約會場所吧？\n要訂餐廳，這個飯店的氣氛看起來不錯，\n不如就……嗯？你說進展太快了？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥，原來你喜歡這種衣服啊？\n那我就每天穿給你看！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "啊，哥哥，你還在做什麼呢？我們快出去賺錢吧。\n回來一定要大買特買！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥～你什麼時候來啊～\n要是露菲兔被其他小烏龜搶走了怎麼辦！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥……是不是覺得和露菲在一起很無聊？為什麼一句話都不說……？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "深山裡的寶藏～是露菲兔的唷～\n陽光開朗的哥哥～也是露菲兔的唷～",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥知道嗎？前哨基地購物中心真～的有好多有趣的商品！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "啊！你竟然在前哨基地找到了限量版露菲兔，恭喜你！\n你今天一定會非～常幸運！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "等一下我要直播開箱，哥哥要來參加嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "今天要和露菲兔一起探訪金幣之戰！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "天吶，這個包包太漂亮了！付款完畢！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "一起在金幣之戰玩一場遊戲怎麼樣？\n輸的人要答應贏的人一個願望！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥你知道嗎？如果收入過億，消費也過億的話，就會變成窮光蛋噢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "為大家介紹限時出現的露菲兔☆",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "噢噢，我變強了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "既然變得更強了，就要去花更多的錢啊！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "我逛街購物的體力增強了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "兔子兔子～升級！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "升級☆",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "再過不久，我說不定會變成連老虎都敢衝上去揍的兔子～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "天吶！謝謝你，哥哥。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "啊——！哥哥～真的太謝謝你了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "這件禮物正好在我的心願單上！！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "這不是本季剛出的新款嗎！真是太棒了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "我，好感動……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "天吶——！我要去跟露賓們炫耀！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥～你知道嗎？露菲真的好愛你哦！",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥，別再迷惑露菲了～你打算讓露菲喜歡你到什麼地步啊？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "哎呀，哥哥！我好像比以前更更更～喜歡哥哥了。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "露菲兔……終於找到另一半了……！",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "現在開始二選一遊戲！在哥哥和購物之間只能選擇一個？……雖然非常非常痛苦，但我選哥哥哦☆",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "哥哥，我告訴過你吧？我愛你。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "交給我吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "露菲兔，會合完畢！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "作戰方法是什麼？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "嗯（豎起耳朵）～？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "我正在前往！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "蹦蹦！跳跳！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "戰鬥開始！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "放馬過來吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "快點結束戰鬥去購物吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "讓你們見識見識鈔能力！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "給你點顏色瞧瞧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "結束之後，我要去逛街～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "金錢的力量必勝！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "這些會有多少錢啊～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "我要裝彈了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "收銀中！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "嗨喲。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "請支援～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
